    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyo muntu kabili alintwele ku mpongolo iyalosha ku kabanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "awe namona no bucindami bwakwa Lesa wakwa Israeli uko buletula ku kabanga. Ishiwi lyakwa Lesa ninshi lileumfwika kwati ciunda ca kupooma kwa menshi, icalo naco ninshi cilebengeshimafye kulwa bucindami bwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Esek 1:1—7:27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico cimonwa califye nga cilya namwene ilyo Lesa aishile kukonaula umusumba wa Yerusalemu, kabili califye nga cilya namwene ku mumana wa Keba. Awe na ine epakuwa panshi ubukupeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No bucindami bwakwa Lesa epakupita pa mpongolo ya ku kabanga, bwaingila na mwi Tempele lyakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Umupashi wanjimya, wantwala mu lubansa lwa mwilinga lyamukati, awe namona nokuti ubucindami bwakwa Yawe bwaisula mwi Tempele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo uyo muntu acili naiminina apo nali, elyo naumfwa umo alelanda kuli ine ukufuma mwi Tempele, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anjeba nokuti, “We mwana wa muntu, ala ni muno emwaba icipuna candi icabufumu kabili icifulo icakunyantapo amakasa yandi. Ni muno nakulaikala pe na bena Israeli. Aba ŋanda yakwa Israeli pamo ne shamfumu shabo tabakatale abakowesha ishina lyandi nakabili, pakucita ubucende bwakupepa imilungu, na pakulakuulila ishamfumu shabo ishafwa ifyakushibukishishako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishamfumu shabo pakukuula amayanda yashiko, shalepalamika iminshi yabo na maingwe ya fiibi fyabo mupepi ne minshi na maingwe ya fiibi fya ŋanda yandi, icakuti paleshalafye icibumba cimo icaletulekanya. Balekowesha ishina lyandi pakulacita ifintu ifyabunani, ecalengele ukuti na ine mbonaule ku cipyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino lyena bali nokuleka ubucende bwakulapepa imilungu, bali nokonaula na filya bakuulile ishamfumu shabo ishafwa. Nga efyo bacita, awe ninshi na ine nakulaikalilila nabo pe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kanshi nobe we mwana wa muntu, ale akulondolwela aba ŋanda yakwa Israeli palwe Tempele, na palwa mikuulile yaliko, uleke bekatwe insoni pa mulandu wa micitile yabo iyabubifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga baikatwa insoni pafyo bacita, elyo ubalondolwele ifyo Itempele lyatantikwa, emukuti ifyo lyapiminwe pakulikuula, ifyaba iminshi iyakwingililamo ne yakufuminamo, ifyo Itempele limoneka, umusango fyonse fyatantikilwamo, kumo kwine na mafunde ne fipope fyaliko fyonse. Ubalembele ifyo fyonse, epakuti abene baleibelengela umusango fyonse fyatantikilwamo, bamone no kulakonka ifipope fyaliko fyonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi ifunde palwe Tempele nili, ilyakuti incendefye yonse pa mulu wa lupili, iyashinguluka Itempele, ala ni ncende iyamushilo nganshi. Ili e funde ilye Tempele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi e fipimo fya bulambo mu makubiti ayataliko, aya makubiti yalepele kubiti umo ukulundapo ne cisansa ca lupi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kubiti umo walepele citika wa mita (0.5m), ne cisansa ca lupi nalimo 8 cms.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Apaimikwe ubulambo bonse pasanswike kubiti umo, mubufumo namo kubiti umo, kwali no mushingo ukushinguluka uwalingene ne cisansa ca lupi. Ifi efyalepele ubulambo ukufuma panshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukutula apo ubulambo bwaimikwe ukufika na mu mushingo wa mwisamba bwali amakubiti yabili ukuya mumulu, mubufumo kubiti umo. Elyo ukufuma mu mushingo wa mwisamba ukufika na mu mushingo wa pamulu palepele amakubiti yane elyo mubufumo kubiti umo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pamulu epali ishiko ilyo baleocelapo amalambo ilyasanswike amakubiti yane, na pamulu weshiko pene patumpwike insengo shine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishiko lya pa bulambo lyali ilyalingana, monse monse lyali amakubiti ikumi limo na yabili mubutali na mubufumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Incende ya pakati nayo yalilingene mubukulu, monse monse yali amakubiti ikumi limo na yane, no mushingo uwali citika wa kubiti, ne shinte ilyali kubiti umo ukushinguluka. Amatabo ayakuiila pa bulambo yabelele lubali lwa ku kabanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo alinjebele ati, “We mwana wa muntu, Imfumu Yawe asosa ukutila aya e mafunde bali nokukonka palwa bulambo. Pa bushiku bwine nga bapwa ukukuula ubulambo, pakutuula amalambo yakoca na pakukana umulopa wa nama ishikalatuulwa ilambo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mukapeela umusepela umo uwa ŋombe ilume ngo mutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi kuli bashimapepo abena Levi, bamwana Sadoki, abali nokulaisa apo ndi kukumombela. Efyasosa Imfumu Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muli nokubuulapo umulopa wakako, no kuushinga ku nsengo shine ishaba pa mulu wa bulambo, na ku matungi yane aya ncende ya pakati, na ku mishingo yonsefye. Kanshi efyo ukasangulula ubulambo no kubufutilako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukabuule cilume wa ŋombe no kuleka ilambo lya mutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi. Ukamubuule ukamoce mu lubansa mwilinga lyakunse pa ncende iyasontwa, kunse ya ncende iyamushilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Elyo pa bushiku bwacibili mukabuulepo sawe umo uwabula akalema, mukatuule ilambo lyakwelelwa pa bubifi. Mukabuule no mulopa wakwe mukasangulwileko ubulambo, nga filya fine mukabalilapo ukucita kuli cilume wa ŋombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico nga capwa, elyo mukabuule cilume wa ŋombe umo uwabula akalema, na sukusuku umo nao uwabula akalema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mukafilete fyonse kuli ine ne Yawe. Bashimapepo bakasansapo umucele, no kufituula nge lambo ilyakoca.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
