              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pa nshiku cine lubali muli nokulatuula inshiku shonse sawe umo, na cilume wa ŋombe nao umo, na sukusuku nao umo, ngo mutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi. Isho nama shonse shili nokuba ishabula akalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa nshiku cine lubali bashimapepo bali nokufutilako ubulambo no kubusangulula efyo bakandubwila ubulambo pakubupekanya ukulabombelapo imilimo yabuko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isho nshiku nga shapwa, pa bushiku bwalenga cine konse konse nokuya kuntanshi elyo bashimapepo bali nokutampa ukulalekela pa bulambo amalambo yenu ayakoca, na malambo yenu ayakwampana. Elyo ninshi na ine nkalamusekelela imwe. Efyasosa Imfumu Yawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.27"
            ]
          }
        }
